  "sourceRuleRecords": [
    {
      "existingCanonicalId": "CN-d6fd7140f106f9b5-P095-B022",
      "sourceRecord": {
        "id": "DOC-01-P095-B022",
        "document": "DOC-01",
        "page": 95,
        "clauseAnchors": [
          "470.1"
        ],
        "text": "470.1.           得分行动 与获得分数 是两个不同的过程。得分行动 可能会让玩家获得分数 ,但两者没有必然联系。",
        "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
        "implementation": [],
        "tests": []
      }
    },
    {
      "existingCanonicalId": "CN-d6fd7140f106f9b5-P096-B003",
      "sourceRecord": {
        "id": "DOC-01-P096-B003",
        "document": "DOC-01",
        "page": 96,
        "clauseAnchors": [
          "471.1"
        ],
        "text": "471.1.             征服: 玩家获得一处战场 的控制权 (该战场必须是玩家尚未在本回合得分 的场地)。",
        "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
        "implementation": [],
        "tests": []
      }
    },
    {
      "existingCanonicalId": "CN-d6fd7140f106f9b5-P096-B007",
      "sourceRecord": {
        "id": "DOC-01-P096-B007",
        "document": "DOC-01",
        "page": 96,
        "clauseAnchors": [
          "472"
        ],
        "text": "472.         每个回合,玩家只能通过征服和据守从每个战场获得一分。",
        "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
        "implementation": [],
        "tests": []
      }
    },
    {
      "existingCanonicalId": "CN-d6fd7140f106f9b5-P096-B011",
      "sourceRecord": {
        "id": "DOC-01-P096-B011",
        "document": "DOC-01",
        "page": 96,
        "clauseAnchors": [
          "473.1.a.1"
        ],
        "text": "473.1.a.1.                   注意,只有通过征服获得的分数才会受到此限制。",
        "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
        "implementation": [],
        "tests": []
      }
    },
    {
      "existingCanonicalId": "CN-d6fd7140f106f9b5-P096-B012",
      "sourceRecord": {
        "id": "DOC-01-P096-B012",
        "document": "DOC-01",
        "page": 96,
        "clauseAnchors": [
          "473.1.b"
        ],
        "text": "473.1.b.               当玩家试图通过征服获得分数,且其当前总分数为当前游戏模式胜利得分 减 1 或更高时,会发生以下情\n                       况:",
        "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
        "implementation": [],
        "tests": []
      }
    },
    {
      "existingCanonicalId": "CN-d6fd7140f106f9b5-P096-B013",
      "sourceRecord": {
        "id": "DOC-01-P096-B013",
        "document": "DOC-01",
        "page": 96,
        "clauseAnchors": [
          "473.1.b.1"
        ],
        "text": "473.1.b.1.                   如果该玩家在本回合已在每个战场得分,则该玩家获得最后一分。如果该玩家在本回合尚未在\n                             每个战场得分,则该玩家改为抽一张牌。",
        "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
        "implementation": [],
        "tests": []
      }
    },
    {
      "existingCanonicalId": "CN-d6fd7140f106f9b5-P096-B014",
      "sourceRecord": {
        "id": "DOC-01-P096-B014",
        "document": "DOC-01",
        "page": 96,
        "clauseAnchors": [
          "473.2"
        ],
        "text": "473.2.             在得分的战场上触发得分技能。",
        "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
        "implementation": [],
        "tests": []
      }
    },
    {
      "existingCanonicalId": "CN-d6fd7140f106f9b5-P096-B018",
      "sourceRecord": {
        "id": "DOC-01-P096-B018",
        "document": "DOC-01",
        "page": 96,
        "clauseAnchors": [
          "474"
        ],
        "text": "474.         当清理发生时,如果玩家累计的分数大于或等于其游戏模式的胜利得分,且分数高于所有对手,则该玩家赢得游戏。",
        "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
        "implementation": [],
        "tests": []
      }
    },
    {
      "existingCanonicalId": "CN-d6fd7140f106f9b5-P096-B015",
      "sourceRecord": {
        "id": "DOC-01-P096-B015",
        "document": "DOC-01",
        "page": 96,
        "clauseAnchors": [
          "473.2.a"
        ],
        "text": "473.2.a.               在被征服的战场上触发征服技能。",
        "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
        "implementation": [],
        "tests": []
      }
    },
    {
      "existingCanonicalId": "CN-d6fd7140f106f9b5-P096-B017",
      "sourceRecord": {
        "id": "DOC-01-P096-B017",
        "document": "DOC-01",
        "page": 96,
        "clauseAnchors": [
          "473.2.c"
        ],
        "text": "473.2.c.               这些技能仅会在战场得分时触发;即每名玩家每回合仅能触发一次。",
        "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
        "implementation": [],
        "tests": []
      }
    },
    {
      "existingCanonicalId": "CN-d6fd7140f106f9b5-P033-B009",
      "sourceRecord": {
        "id": "DOC-01-P033-B009",
        "document": "DOC-01",
        "page": 33,
        "clauseAnchors": [
          "303.1"
        ],
        "text": "303.1.            任何性质的游戏行动,同一时间内仅可进行一个,且必须完整执行。",
        "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
        "implementation": [],
        "tests": []
      }
    },
    {
      "existingCanonicalId": "CN-d6fd7140f106f9b5-P072-B010",
      "sourceRecord": {
        "id": "DOC-01-P072-B010",
        "document": "DOC-01",
        "page": 72,
        "clauseAnchors": [
          "414.4.c"
        ],
        "text": "414.4.c.             抽取完成抽牌行动所需的其余卡牌。",
        "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
        "implementation": [],
        "tests": []
      }
    },
    {
      "existingCanonicalId": "CN-d6fd7140f106f9b5-P082-B006",
      "sourceRecord": {
        "id": "DOC-01-P082-B006",
        "document": "DOC-01",
        "page": 82,
        "clauseAnchors": [
          "432.2.b"
        ],
        "text": "432.2.b.               将废牌堆的卡牌回收至主牌堆。\n                            提示:当多张卡牌同时被回收至主牌堆时,必须先行洗匀。",
        "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
        "implementation": [],
        "tests": []
      }
    },
    {
      "existingCanonicalId": "CN-d6fd7140f106f9b5-P082-B007",
      "sourceRecord": {
        "id": "DOC-01-P082-B007",
        "document": "DOC-01",
        "page": 82,
        "clauseAnchors": [
          "432.2.c"
        ],
        "text": "432.2.c.               选择一名对手,使其获得 1 分。",
        "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
        "implementation": [],
        "tests": []
      }
    },
    {
      "existingCanonicalId": "CN-d6fd7140f106f9b5-P082-B008",
      "sourceRecord": {
        "id": "DOC-01-P082-B008",
        "document": "DOC-01",
        "page": 82,
        "clauseAnchors": [
          "432.2.d"
        ],
        "text": "432.2.d.               完成原本让自己触发燃尽的剩余行动。\n                            举例:一名玩家在主牌堆耗尽的情况下,在抽牌步骤尝试抽取一张卡牌,因此触发燃尽。该玩\n                            家转而将废牌堆回收后放入主牌堆,照常洗匀;然后选择一名对手,使其获得 1 分;最后,该\n                            玩家抽一张牌。",
        "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
        "implementation": [],
        "tests": []
      }
    },
    {
      "existingCanonicalId": "CN-d6fd7140f106f9b5-P082-B009",
      "sourceRecord": {
        "id": "DOC-01-P082-B009",
        "document": "DOC-01",
        "page": 82,
        "clauseAnchors": [
          "432.3"
        ],
        "text": "432.3.            玩家的主牌堆可能在执行燃尽后仍然为空,这通常是因为其废牌堆同样为空。当其尝试再次执行原本触发燃尽的行\n                  动时,将再次触发燃尽。",
        "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
        "implementation": [],
        "tests": []
      }
    },
    {
      "existingCanonicalId": "CN-d6fd7140f106f9b5-P082-B012",
      "sourceRecord": {
        "id": "DOC-01-P082-B012",
        "document": "DOC-01",
        "page": 82,
        "clauseAnchors": [
          "432.3.c"
        ],
        "text": "432.3.c.               在按顺序处理第一个燃尽后获得的分数,如果使玩家的得分达到或超过该模式的胜利得分,并且该玩家的\n                       得分高于所有对手,则该玩家将获胜。\n                            举例:如果玩家的牌堆和废牌堆均为空,且将要抽一张牌,该玩家会开始反复燃尽。在首次燃\n                            尽结算后,任何后续燃尽只要让某位玩家的得分超过胜利得分,并且高于所有对手,该玩家就\n                            会赢得游戏。",
        "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
        "implementation": [],
        "tests": []
      }
    },
    {
      "existingCanonicalId": "CN-d6fd7140f106f9b5-P082-B013",
      "sourceRecord": {
        "id": "DOC-01-P082-B013",
        "document": "DOC-01",
        "page": 82,
        "clauseAnchors": [
          "432.3.c.1"
        ],
        "text": "432.3.c.1.                  该玩家立即获胜,无需等待清理发生。",
        "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
        "implementation": [],
        "tests": []
      }
    },
    {
      "existingCanonicalId": "CN-d6fd7140f106f9b5-P072-B001",
      "sourceRecord": {
        "id": "DOC-01-P072-B001",
        "document": "DOC-01",
        "page": 72,
        "clauseAnchors": [
          "414.1"
        ],
        "text": "414.1.          抽一张牌 是指从某区域拿取一张牌,并将其添加到玩家的手牌 中。",
        "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
        "implementation": [],
        "tests": []
      }
    },
    {
      "existingCanonicalId": "CN-d6fd7140f106f9b5-P072-B002",
      "sourceRecord": {
        "id": "DOC-01-P072-B002",
        "document": "DOC-01",
        "page": 72,
        "clauseAnchors": [
          "414.1.a"
        ],
        "text": "414.1.a.             除非另有说明,否则抽牌即为从主牌堆的顶部抽取卡牌。",
        "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
        "implementation": [],
        "tests": []
      }
    },
    {
      "existingCanonicalId": "CN-d6fd7140f106f9b5-P096-B006",
      "sourceRecord": {
        "id": "DOC-01-P096-B006",
        "document": "DOC-01",
        "page": 96,
        "clauseAnchors": [
          "471.2"
        ],
        "text": "471.2.             据守: 玩家保持一处战场 的控制权 (该战场必须是玩家尚未在本回合开始阶段得分 的场地)。",
        "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
        "implementation": [],
        "tests": []
      }
    },
    {
      "existingCanonicalId": "CN-d6fd7140f106f9b5-P096-B016",
      "sourceRecord": {
        "id": "DOC-01-P096-B016",
        "document": "DOC-01",
        "page": 96,
        "clauseAnchors": [
          "473.2.b"
        ],
        "text": "473.2.b.               在被据守的战场上触发据守技能。",
        "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
        "implementation": [],
        "tests": []
      }
    },
    {
      "existingCanonicalId": "CN-d6fd7140f106f9b5-P095-B023",
      "sourceRecord": {
        "id": "DOC-01-P095-B023",
        "document": "DOC-01",
        "page": 95,
        "clauseAnchors": [
          "470.2"
        ],
        "text": "470.2.           卡牌文本将以如下方式描述获得分数的过程:“获得 X 分”或者“获得的分数+X”。此处的“获得分数”并不是指得分行\n                 动 这一过程。",
        "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
        "implementation": [],
        "tests": []
      }
    }
  ],
